FX panel becomes unclickable when virtual keyboard is open.

The bottom panels (synth editor, mixer/FX) overlap with the virtual keyboard
when both are visible. The keyboard's Nuklear window steals input from panels
behind it. Fixed: bottom_h now shrinks when keyboard is visible.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [x] Bottom panels shrink to make room for keyboard
- [ ] All FX controls are clickable with keyboard open
- [ ] Layout doesn't break at small window sizes

## Test Plan
- [ ] Open FX + PIANO, verify FX sliders work
- [ ] Resize window small with both open, verify no overlap
